        "collapsible_tab_UVCUhL": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "key benefits",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Wearable data that finally improves</strong><br/>The HRV and recovery trend that's been flat for months - moving. Tracked by the device you already trust.</li><li><strong>All-day energy, no crash</strong><br/>Steady through the 3pm slump, sharp into the evening - without borrowing it from caffeine.</li><li><strong>Wake up actually recovered</strong><br/>Not still paying for yesterday's session, or yesterday's workday.</li><li><strong>One protocol instead of seven bottles</strong><br/>Replaces a typical cellular stack - and around £75/month of separate supplements.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_9i6P8C": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does NAD+ really work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Energy</strong><br/>NAD+ fuels your mitochondria, your cells' energy engines, and by 40, most people have roughly half of what they started with. Published research found NAD+ levels rose 51% in 14 days (clinically measured, Conze et al., 2019).</li><li><strong>Recovery</strong><br/>NAD+ drives cellular repair, not just rest. As NAD+ is restored, that repair process is better resourced.</li><li><strong>Performance</strong><br/>Performance runs on energy and recovery. Restore the NAD+ that fuels your mitochondria, and the output above it gets easier to sustain.</li><li><strong>Wearables</strong><br/>HRV, recovery score, and sleep are windows into what's happening inside your mitochondria - including how well they're being replenished.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aTVdqw": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why NAD⁺ Alone Isn't Enough",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>Most NAD⁺ supplements give you a precursor and stop there. But making NAD⁺ is only the first of three jobs - skip the other two and you're paying to produce NAD⁺ your body loses or never turns into energy you feel.</li><li><strong>Produce</strong> - NR gives your cells the building block they turn into NAD⁺. Essential, but on its own it's one third of the job. It's where NMN and NR stop - and where MUTO starts.</li><li><strong>Protect</strong> - An enzyme (CD38) breaks NAD⁺ down almost as fast as you make it. Quercetin, Pterostilbene, Grapeseed and Turmeric slow that leak, so the NAD⁺ you produce actually sticks around.</li><li><strong>Put to Work</strong> - NAD⁺ in your blood isn't energy yet. CoQ10 and BioPerine® help your cells absorb it and turn it into energy you feel - not just a better number on a lab report.</li><li>Produce without Protect is a leaking tank. Produce without Put to Work is fuel you never burn. NR and NMN do one job. MUTO does all three.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_GaxMqg": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li><strong>Two capsules. Every morning. Same time.</strong><br/>Take with food - healthy fats drive absorption.</li><li><strong>Daily consistency is key for optimal results.<br/></strong>The benefits build daily, weekly and monthly.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
